#: windows.cpp:196
msgid ""
"When this option is enabled, a window in the background will automatically come "
"to the front when the mouse pointer has been over it for some time."
msgstr ""
"Bu köylämä açıq bulsa, küse uğı arta torğan berär täräzä ütkändä ul täräzä eş "
"üzägenä çığarılaçaq."

#: windows.cpp:198
msgid ""
"This is the delay after which the window that the mouse pointer is over will "
"automatically come to the front."
msgstr "Bu ara uzğaç qına, küse ütkän täräzä alğa yözep çığaçaq."

#: windows.cpp:202
msgid ""
"When this option is enabled, the active window will be brought to the front "
"when you click somewhere into the window contents. To change it for inactive "
"windows, you need to change the settings in the Actions tab."
msgstr ""
"Bu köylämä açıq bulsa, eşçän täräzä eçtälegenä çirtkändä ul täräzä eş üzägenä "
"çığarılaçaq. Arttağı täräzälärgä dä şulay uqı itü öçen, Eşlär digän tabaqta "
"bulğan köylämälärne üzgärtäse."

#: windows.cpp:207
msgid ""
"When this option is enabled, there will be a delay after which the window the "
"mouse pointer is over will become active (receive focus)."
msgstr ""
"Bu köylämä açıq bulsa, küse uğı arta torğan berär täräzä ütkändä ul täräzä "
"beraz kötterep kenä eş üzägenä çığarılaçaq."

#: windows.cpp:209
msgid ""
"This is the delay after which the window the mouse pointer is over will "
"automatically receive focus."
msgstr "Bu ara uzğaç qına, küse uğı ütkän täräzä eş üzägenä çığaçaq."

#: windows.cpp:214
msgid "Navigation"
