#: windows.cpp:218
msgid "Show window list while switching windows"
msgstr "Täräzä arasında küçkändä täräzälär tezmäsen kürsätäse"

#: windows.cpp:221
msgid ""
"Hold down the Alt key and press the Tab key repeatedly to walk through the "
"windows on the current desktop (the Alt+Tab combination can be reconfigured).\n"
"\n"
"If this checkbox is checked a popup widget is shown, displaying the icons of "
"all windows to walk through and the title of the currently selected one.\n"
"\n"
"Otherwise, the focus is passed to a new window each time Tab is pressed, with "
"no popup widget.  In addition, the previously activated window will be sent to "
"the back in this mode."
msgstr ""
"Basılğan Alt töymäse belän bergä Tab töymäse aşa biredäge östäldä bulğan "
"täräzälär arasında küçep bula (Alt-Tab çaptırmasın üzgärtep tä bula).\n"
"\n"
"Bu köylämä açıq bulsa, atılma widget eçendä täräzälär tamğalarınnan torğan "
"tezmä kürsäteläçäk.\n"
"\n"
"Yuq isä, Tab basılğan sayın eşüzäk kiläse täräzägä küçäçäk, soñğı eşçän täräzä "
"isä ul tezmä azağına quyıla. Bu çaqta atılma widget kürsätelmi inde. "

#: windows.cpp:232
msgid "&Traverse windows on all desktops"
msgstr "&Bar öställärdäge täräzälär arasında"

#: windows.cpp:235
msgid ""
