msgid "Shading"
msgstr "Külägäläw"

#: windows.cpp:529
msgid "Anima&te"
msgstr "Canlan&dıru"

#: windows.cpp:530
msgid ""
"Animate the action of reducing the window to its titlebar (shading) as well as "
